  "description": [
    "A monothioacetal that consists of cytosine having a (2<i>R</i>,5<i>S</i>)-2-(hydroxymethyl)-1,3-oxathiolan-5-yl moiety attached at position 1. An inhibitor of HIV-1 reverse transcriptase, it is used as an antiviral in the treatment of AIDS and hepatitis B."
  ],
